    "turn_text": "Well, speaking of walls, and ironically enough, when it comes to Democrats and their perspective of walls, we've seen a wall go up around the Capitol, which is keeping taxpayers out right now and visiting the members that they sent to Congress. But the wall at the Southern border that was being built to keep out drug cartels and illegals, that's, you know, construction has been stopped as we talked about. So do you see any sort of double standard here at all?",
